1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,465
Fractional or full-time CFO?

2
00:00:02,465 --> 00:00:04,996
Don't start with the job title.

3
00:00:04,996 --> 00:00:08,634
Start with what your board needs every month.

4
00:00:09,334 --> 00:00:10,739
Here's one example.

5
00:00:10,739 --> 00:00:20,353
In the UAE, a taxable person generally files the corporate tax return, and pays, within nine months of the end of the tax period.

6
00:00:20,353 --> 00:00:31,521
For a December twenty twenty-six year-end, that points to the thirtieth of September, twenty twenty-seven, unless the tax authority sets another date.

7
00:00:32,221 --> 00:00:33,886
So ask three questions.

8
00:00:33,886 --> 00:00:37,288
Are the monthly numbers final by a fixed date?

9
00:00:37,288 --> 00:00:40,329
Can you see your cash three months ahead?

10
00:00:40,329 --> 00:00:43,442
And does one person own every filing date?

11
00:00:44,142 --> 00:00:51,282
If that's what your board needs, a few days a month of CFO-level support can often cover it.

12
00:00:51,282 --> 00:01:00,206
If finance decisions come up every day, across several entities or lenders, a full-time hire starts to make sense.

13
00:01:00,906 --> 00:01:02,653
Not sure which fits?

14
00:01:02,653 --> 00:01:08,505
Message Valorin on WhatsApp, or email advisory at valorin dot A E.

15
00:01:08,505 --> 00:01:12,959
